  <item>
    <title>【Hi朋友】对话两位商业作者：你的工作够“性感”吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6785c525ebe4d20d45cb7c32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6785c525ebe4d20d45cb7c32</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jan 2025 02:14:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">00:02:30</a> base在北京和上海的不坐班打工人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">00:09:18</a> 从选题到出稿：一条成熟的流水线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">00:13:56</a> 什么是“三段式”写作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">00:20:33</a> 一些担忧：你的工作会被AI取代吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">00:23:25</a> 有趣的行业黑话：你的工作很“性感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">00:29:45</a> 成文或不成文的行业规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">00:39:35</a> 你在职场闯过哪些祸：争做老板的心腹大患</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2945">00:49:05</a> 八年闺蜜如何在领导面前装不熟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3145">00:52:25</a> 满分十分，你会给自己的这份工作打几分？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3551">00:59:11</a> 你的dream job是什么？未来有什么样的职业规划？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4082">01:08:02</a> 没有理想的人不伤心</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/650709d5283348dcad92df19/lt5zJM0W0AThrfb5hFT1nJ5sBiX0.m4a" length="69893245" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:01</itunes:duration>
