    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 15:29:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:00:17</a> 又是一年考研季：章鱼的絮絮叨叨。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">00:02:43</a> 考研专业情况介绍。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">00:04:35</a> 热爱/跟风/机缘巧合？我们为什么选择考研？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">00:11:21</a> 一份考研时间表～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">00:25:44</a> 竞争对手/友谊/季节更替……考研送给我们一只回忆的口袋。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">00:43:32</a> 如果可以，请别放弃！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3024">00:50:24</a> 从备考到考取，哪一个时刻最快乐？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">00:52:48</a> 如果没考上研究生，我们会怎样？</span></p><p><span>片尾bgm：The Best Is Yet To Come  Sheppard</span></p>]]></description>
