  <item>
    <title>【第10期】《素食者》：一个女人的慢性溺水</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672dbf8582eb19451d225efa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672dbf8582eb19451d225efa</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Nov 2024 07:45:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 遇见诺贝尔文学奖作者韩江。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 漫谈：《素食者》故事梗概及叙事特点。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 很心疼vs.很难评——说一说“姐姐”和“姐夫”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 女性群体之间的自助和她助为何如此悲壮？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> “爱上他人的妻子”难道是男人们的默契？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 从“乱伦”解析英惠受害全过程。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> “胎记”究竟是艺术缪斯还是性欲投射？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 《素食者》主题探寻。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">54:32</a> 结尾：文学会打破语言的高墙，韩江获奖感言。</span></p>]]></description>
