  <item>
    <title>章鱼一周岁｜将生活当成一场耕种，也把自己当成一颗种子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671f4094d6a26a393ca0fa83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671f4094d6a26a393ca0fa83</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 07:54:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>结尾bgm：Need Some Time &nbsp;对角巷乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">00:01:47</a> 一周年的小小总结～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">00:03:58</a> 默契大考验（失败）：猜猜对方最喜欢哪一期节目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">00:10:07</a> 做播客对我们的影响：把自己当成一个farmer，同时把自己当成一颗种子。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">00:17:06</a> 计划也没用，没用也计划：接下来想做什么样的内容？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">00:22:35</a> 求学经历：被数学双双逼成文科生！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">00:31:40</a> 隔行如隔山：聊聊对对方专业的理解（新闻&amp;人类学&amp;文学&amp;语言学）？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">00:42:30</a> 我真的理解自己的专业吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3174">00:52:54</a> 人文社科真的“难搞”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">00:54:52</a> 像一名人类学家/语言学家那样生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3663">01:01:03</a> Yes or No? 要不要来学新闻学/人类学/语言学/文学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3912">01:05:12</a> Reading for fun! 入门书籍倾情推荐~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnIOdhtI9_3PYmgDHemZN3ZSdJ-p.m4a" length="67895463" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhioeVe_ISKIgKsCZfYYITY--UdO.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【第9期】“死亡不是失去生命，而是走出了时间”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6709bf016c7f8177866c44b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6709bf016c7f8177866c44b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Oct 2024 00:12:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“死亡不是失去生命，而是走出了时间。”——余华</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾bgm：生活倒影 &nbsp;苏运莹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">00:03:50</a> 那些已经离开的亲人和朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">00:15:40</a> 死亡带给我们的影响是“长久地注视一个人”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a> 我决定不再试图弄懂大人的规则了，我要在每个想要提起TA的时候提起TA。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">00:34:55</a> 你惧怕死亡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">00:40:45</a> 最心仪的死法&amp;最想要的葬礼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">00:46:37</a> 死亡“就像水消失在水中”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3381">00:56:21</a> 死亡将人类一分为二，我们从一个集合流入另一个集合，最终流入死亡本身。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luT1kAjwvbC8FeglHWaxCByieBzv.m4a" length="64439761" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhioeVe_ISKIgKsCZfYYITY--UdO.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
